<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reply to your support request</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #007bff;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .original-message {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #6c757d;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .reply-message {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6c757d;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
        .attachment-info {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h2>Reply to Your Support Request</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for contacting our support team. We have reviewed your request and here's our response:</p>
        
        <div class="original-message">
            <strong>Your original message:</strong><br>
            {{originalMessage}}
        </div>
        
        <div class="reply-message">
            <strong>Our response ({{staffName}}):</strong><br>
            {{replyMessage}}
        </div>
        
        {{#if hasAttachments}}
        <div class="attachment-info">
            <strong>📎 Attachments included:</strong>
            <ul>
                {{#each attachments}}
                <li>{{this.fileName}} ({{this.fileSize}})</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
            <p><small>You can find the attachments in your email or download them from the links below:</small></p>
            <ul>
                {{#each attachments}}
                <li><a href="{{this.url}}">{{this.fileName}}</a></li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        
        <p>If you have any further questions, please don't hesitate to reply to this email or create a new support request.</p>
        
        <a href="{{ticketUrl}}" class="btn">View Your Ticket</a>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{staffName}}</strong><br>
        Support Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated response to your support request. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
        <p>&copy; {{year}} Your Company Name. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>